<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

  <!--
    ANOOBA_DRAWSIZE_FIX_1 — owner, live review 2026-09-14: the Anooba renders
    far oversized.

    Root cause is in the DONOR mod itself, "Star Wars Animal Collection
    (Continued)" (packageId mlie.starwarsanimalcollection, workshop id
    3497316713) — this is the mod whose bare `Anooba` PawnKindDef is wired
    into RM_Pyrelands's wildAnimals by WildAnimals_Pyrelands.xml (NOT this
    repo's own RSW_Anooba port in src/RimStarWars/SWBestiary, which is a
    separate def used only to resolve a ZBiome_Grasslands collision and is
    not wired to any biome by that change).

    MEASURED in the donor's own file
    (workshop/content/294100/3497316713/1.6/Defs/ThingDefs_Races/
    Races_Animal_SW.xml, PawnKindDef defName="Anooba"): adult lifeStage
    drawSize is 3.0 against a race baseBodySize of 0.95 — bigger than
    vanilla Warg's adult drawSize of 2.15 despite Warg's baseBodySize being
    larger (1.4). Applying Warg's own drawSize/bodySize ratio (2.15/1.4 ~=
    1.54) to Anooba's 0.95 gives ~1.46, rounded to 1.5; pup/juvenile keep the
    donor's original 0.5/0.667 ratio to the adult value (0.75/1.0/1.5).

    Same numbers (1.5/2/3 verbatim) were separately fixed in this repo's own
    RSW_Anooba.xml port for the unrelated collision-fix def — that edit does
    NOT reach the live Pyrelands Anooba, hence this patch.
  -->

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Star Wars Animal Collection (Continued)</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="Anooba"]/lifeStages/li[1]/bodyGraphicData/drawSize</xpath>
          <value><drawSize>0.75</drawSize></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="Anooba"]/lifeStages/li[1]/femaleGraphicData/drawSize</xpath>
          <value><drawSize>0.75</drawSize></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="Anooba"]/lifeStages/li[1]/dessicatedBodyGraphicData/drawSize</xpath>
          <value><drawSize>0.75</drawSize></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="Anooba"]/lifeStages/li[2]/bodyGraphicData/drawSize</xpath>
          <value><drawSize>1.0</drawSize></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="Anooba"]/lifeStages/li[2]/femaleGraphicData/drawSize</xpath>
          <value><drawSize>1.0</drawSize></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="Anooba"]/lifeStages/li[2]/dessicatedBodyGraphicData/drawSize</xpath>
          <value><drawSize>1.0</drawSize></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="Anooba"]/lifeStages/li[3]/bodyGraphicData/drawSize</xpath>
          <value><drawSize>1.5</drawSize></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="Anooba"]/lifeStages/li[3]/femaleGraphicData/drawSize</xpath>
          <value><drawSize>1.5</drawSize></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="Anooba"]/lifeStages/li[3]/dessicatedBodyGraphicData/drawSize</xpath>
          <value><drawSize>1.5</drawSize></value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
